# A recursive rule: ancestors are parents, or parents of ancestors
Mona is Homer's mother.
Abe is the father of Homer.
Homer is Bart's dad.
If X is the mother of Y then X is a parent of Y.
If X is the father of Y then X is a parent of Y.
X is an ancestor of Y if X is a parent of Y.
X is an ancestor of Y if X is a parent of Z and Z is an ancestor of Y.
# Try: Who are Bart's ancestors?
